{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the puzzle by dragging the colored tiles to get the perfect gradient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511670/extras/e61856516a0f72816288d1a32efd7322.poster.avif?t=1741007728\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511670/extras/e61856516a0f72816288d1a32efd7322.webm?t=1741007728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511670/extras/e61856516a0f72816288d1a32efd7322.mp4?t=1741007728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has two modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal mode:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty is gradually increasing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try your hand at solving the puzzle in one turn:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511670/extras/516e4316e178ed170bf5f0a959746b28.poster.avif?t=1741007728\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511670/extras/516e4316e178ed170bf5f0a959746b28.webm?t=1741007728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511670/extras/516e4316e178ed170bf5f0a959746b28.mp4?t=1741007728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or put together a puzzle in the given time:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511670/extras/4f2af4163f428db3baeb6e6ad8dde993.poster.avif?t=1741007728\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511670/extras/4f2af4163f428db3baeb6e6ad8dde993.webm?t=1741007728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511670/extras/4f2af4163f428db3baeb6e6ad8dde993.mp4?t=1741007728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the level generation to suit your mood and play without paying attention to time or the number of moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511670/extras/6075d5757f44767bb70aa7b3dea61aec.poster.avif?t=1741007728\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511670/extras/6075d5757f44767bb70aa7b3dea61aec.webm?t=1741007728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511670/extras/6075d5757f44767bb70aa7b3dea61aec.mp4?t=1741007728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Swap 50 ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3511670/d60578c357c7d72c0cf8df3df4f71763dee2a4ad.jpg"},{"name":"Swap 100 ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3511670/8772b337c6e8fcb69e3adf3991f30d90743b22ab.jpg"},{"name":"Swap 250 ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3511670/09dec5dfd3485fe681982a27d3e3aed29f87a0a7.jpg"},{"name":"Swap 500 ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3511670/354790f9fc60f43222fd65e02d6a940bb6c3cacb.jpg"},{"name":"Swap 1000 ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/im